# hugmesh-go-live-at-ready (#1201) — "Go live when ready": every minute, check each
# build-time opted-in domain (/etc/hugmesh/domain-go-live) and take it public once this
# public-edge node's pods are ready and the domain's front door answers. Does nothing
# without that file; acts once per domain (a later manual rollback is not overridden).
#
# Field order: min hour dom month dow user command
* * * * * root /usr/sbin/hugmesh-go-live-at-ready >> /var/log/hugmesh-go-live-at-ready.log 2>&1
